# Code Quality Gate

Purpose:
  Per-language linters and formatters enforced before review stage.
  Ensures code cleanliness before human or AI review.

Owns: testing\CODE-QUALITY-GATE.sdd

## Language Tool Registry

Tools:
  go:
    lint: golangci-lint run
    format: go fmt ./...
  typescript:
    lint: tsc --noEmit
    format: prettier --write .
  javascript:
    lint: eslint .
    format: prettier --write .
  python:
    lint: pylint **/*.py
    format: black .
  php:
    lint: php -l **/*.php
    format: php-cs-fixer fix
  rust:
    lint: cargo clippy
    format: rustfmt --check .

## Gate Rules

Gate:
  - ALL tools for the project languages must pass.
  - Gate runs BEFORE review stage.
  - Fix auto-applied where possible (format).
  - Lint errors must be resolved before proceeding.

## Report

Report:
  language: {lang}
  lint: pass|fail
  format: pass|fail|fixed
  issues: [list]

State: +
